===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|roche}}, from {{der|en|fro|roche}}, from {{der|en|gml|[[roche]], [[ruche]]||ray (fish)}}, from {{der|en|osx|*rūh}}, possibly from {{der|en|gem-pro|*rūhaz|t=rough}}.

Cognate with {{cog|ang|ruhha}} {{gloss|"a ray"; > {{cog|enm|rouhe}}, {{m|enm|rohȝe}}}}, {{cog|de|Rochen||ray (fish)}}.
[[File:A photo of a common roach with a lot fishes in aquarium.jpg|thumb|a {{vern|common roach}} (''{{ll|mul|Rutilus rutilus}}'')]]

