Apparently from extended or figurative use of {{m|en|roach|id=fish|gloss=Cyprinidae}}, above. Compare the adjective {{m|en|roached|gloss=styled so that the mane stands up from the neck}}.
[[File:La Soldat Du Chene, A Osage Chief. (11088429613).jpg|thumb|a '''roach''' as worn by a chief of the [[Osage]] tribe]]
